--- adapted from upstream ThreeSumApsp/Programs/Sec3/Theorem17/Host/Time.lean
-/-- A sum of `m ≤ M` terms `f t ≤ A + B e(t)` is at most `M A + B E` if the `e(t)` add up to at most
