-/-- `|P_L| ≤ M/(1 - ρ)` without fractions: `(L - m + 1 - 9m) |P_L| ≤ (L - m + 1) M` for
-`10 m ≤ L`. (Here `L - m + 1 - 9m` is positive.) -/
