+      v Side, v Source, v StepRow, v StepCol, v MaskTable, v Digits3, v Digits4, v Arr] Res ;;
+    .call Proc.encodeP [v Levels, v Size, v Arr, v Enc +' v BandNo *' v Leaves, v Scratch, v Table,
+      v Pow7, v Pow10] Res)
